-- ACTOR ----------------- errors/spawn_not_actor_2.march

`Job` is a constructor of type `Job`, not an actor, so `spawn` cannot start it. [spawn_not_actor]
`spawn` takes the name of an `actor` declaration, like `spawn(Counter)`.

11 |     let _ = spawn(Job)
                       ^^^

    run `march --explain spawn_not_actor`


